{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_lava_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_lava_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"看護","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lava_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"71f66ef6aba91cd8666adbfae54c3dab7b43deed11aba7eb05904f6a75d816c4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"炎熔發現芙蓉病倒了，她為姐姐看護，然後閉眼歇息了一會。醒來之後，她突然發現，那只是個夢，自己才是生病的人。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"滴滴滴滴——\n滴滴滴滴——\n滴滴滴滴——\n啪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......吵死了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，快起床。"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼都不應一聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不會是在想怎麼賴床吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上還發訊息給我說什麼要去巡診，讓我早點叫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"結果我起來了，你還在睡，哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，愛睡就睡吧，我洗漱去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉你怎麼還睡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"起床啊？"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我也才剛出過外勤回來，這次任務不容易，麻煩得很，除了我也沒幾個人能應付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"本來阿米婭給我放了好幾天假，我能睡一整天的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是為了叫你，我也不會閉眼一兩個小時就，哈啊......"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"還不醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那我可要動手了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚你自己說的，你已經是醫療部的精英之一了，絕對不能遲到，拖也要把你拖起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然也不是第一次說這樣的話了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"但真有機會把你拖出被窩還是頭一回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼。要是沒我，你可怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"還不起？我真的要掀了啊，著涼了別怪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"芙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，你，你怎麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"手怎麼那麼燙？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉？姐？你別嚇我啊，你身體不是一直不錯的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼突然就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"姐，姐，說句話啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我醒了......炎熔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"別晃了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，抱，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"有點冷......沒力氣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是發燒了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"發燒，你也會發燒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"啊對了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"稍微等我一下，我現在就幫你找醫生來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"不是什麼大問題......小炎熔你不用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......這孩子也真是的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"十分鐘後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，我把醫生找來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安賽爾，快幫忙看看，芙蓉還好嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你別急，哎別這樣拉我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的......我還想你突然抓住我有什麼事情，原來是你姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒......事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"病人可沒資格說“沒事”這兩個字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"你們宿舍有體溫計嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"有，有的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"在家庭醫藥箱裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就去拿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"你不要緊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......發燒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"體溫有點高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"使不上力，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"醫藥箱呢，我記得在這裡的啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩天飲食和作息上還好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"健......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"健康餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，當我沒問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"你和亞葉應該都屬於不需要擔心的那種人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是前段時間太勞累了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"找到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"一會......該做的檢測......麻煩你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣她......能安心一點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"來，體溫計！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"請把整個箱子都拿過來，這樣我能給芙蓉做所有的基礎檢測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"她的醫藥箱裡這些設備應該都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"有足夠的資料支撐，我就可以判別她的發熱到底是觸發了身體防禦機制，還是由其他症狀引起的併發症。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"先從檢測體溫開始，來，張嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"怎，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼大礙，就是身體的自主調整過程比較激烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"勞累過度應該是主因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩天好好休息，很快就能恢復。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"飲食清淡一點，少鹽少糖，注意營養均衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說要我給她做健康餐嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"食堂也提供類似的餐品，也不一定要親自做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的要點，芙蓉自己都清楚，我就不列舉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療部那裡我會幫芙蓉請病假的，芬那邊也會和她說一聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個後面幾天沒有外勤或是其他任務吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒是沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"那就應該沒什麼問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安賽爾","speakerId":"char_212_ansel","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼要問了的話，我就先走了，芙蓉的看護就交給你了，炎熔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"唉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我要看護你一兩天是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒學過護理課。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"小炎熔......要去訓練的話......就去吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......可是醫生......沒有那麼弱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"自己可以......照顧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你別多說話！喉嚨疼不疼？要不要喝點水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，呃，不是，我沒說不想照顧你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，那個，我，我沒什麼經驗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"要是什麼地方弄錯了。你不舒服了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你就說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那就這麼定了。現在先吃個早飯，一會我去做，吃完我洗碗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你會不會沒胃口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"不會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那要不要先拿個臉盆讓你洗漱一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"等我一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"（拉了下炎熔的衣角）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，還有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"（做了個謝謝的口型）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼好謝的，你生個病，我多兩天假期，還算划得來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"呃，之前那個臉盆放哪裡去了？\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......總算弄完了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"護理還真麻煩啊，一點都不酷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"要我當眾做這種事我肯定要拒絕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"飽了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"（點點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那就別睜著眼睛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"閉上，好好休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我去洗臉盆，然後去洗碗，再然後——還沒想好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"唉反正就先這樣，有什麼事情，把這個鬧鐘的鬧鈴時間調一下，聽到聲音我就過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"聽話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（拍拍芙蓉的臉）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......刷子，還有洗潔精。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（我剛剛是不是拍了拍芙蓉的臉？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"爸爸媽媽會想念你們的。\n記得經常來信。\n聽話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（爸爸媽媽就喜歡這樣對我們。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（也不知道上周寄出去的信他們有沒有收到。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯......是不是芙蓉也會這麼對我？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"該吃健康餐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"聽話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（呃......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（她要是那樣，多半是想命令我做什麼。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（剛剛那一頓肉粥，也不知道她吃飽沒有。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（要不要給她削個水果呢？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（還是烤點肉？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（真的有點想在她床前架個火爐自己烤肉吃。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（饞死她。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（還是削個水果吧......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我切了點水果，你要吃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"睡得還挺沉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙睡覺的時候看上去倒也沒那麼討厭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（捏了捏芙蓉的臉）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"還是很燙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"希望她能恢復一點，這樣我還能心安理得對她做些惡作劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......忙了半天，我也有點累了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"在她床邊睡一會吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滴滴滴滴——\n滴滴滴滴——\n滴滴滴滴——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滴滴滴滴——\n啪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"吵醒你了嗎，抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"這是給你熱粥的鬧鈴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"現在就吃嗎，還是過一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"現在就吃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"唉唉唉別起來，昨天剛累倒今天就想活蹦亂跳嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"給 我 躺 下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（芙蓉什麼時候力氣那麼大了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我稍微打聽了一下，是Pith小姐帶你出去特訓搞成這樣的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不是Pith老師的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"本來這次就是高強度的訓練安排，最開始看起來會比較嚴酷，不過萬事開頭難嘛，之後習慣了就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不能訓練完就虛成這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得值。這樣訓練下來，我能感覺到自己越來越強了，無論是源石技藝的精準度還是其他方面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"況且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"況且？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"這次特訓前其實我有被提醒過，因為訓練強度比較大，過程會比較艱苦所以要做好心理準備之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我和教官們說：“沒關係的，我姐姐是醫療幹員，就算去掉半條命，只要還有一口氣在，她都能給我救回來。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是這個意思，意會一下就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"小炎熔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"這次就算了，要是之後特訓完你的狀態還是這樣，我會正式向人事部提出異議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"這個也不至於——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管這種訓練能帶給你多少提升，我只關心這會不會對你的身體造成傷害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，你不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉？姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"別，別哭啊，都多大的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我找到你的時候有多擔心嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是沒事嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是體力有些透支，加上一點小擦傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，不是這次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得，自己是怎麼來羅德島的嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"在路上幫一群商人擊退匪徒的時候，被人發現是感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"然後就被商隊留下斷後......我記得當時誰砸了我的腦袋，我就昏過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"再醒過來就發現自己在羅德島上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"傷也被人治好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說是出外勤的幹員順手把我撈回來的？還好只是受了點小傷，沒怎麼麻煩別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"是重傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來以為失散之後能見到個和往常一樣彆扭的你，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"你就躺在手術台上，小炎熔，燒得像個火球......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我卻，幫不上任何忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我唯一能做的，就是在手術結束後幫你做護理......就像現在這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"那個時候，你也不停在床上喊我的名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？等下，我從沒聽說過這種事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那，那你為什麼不說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"還不是因為知道你這傢伙彆扭起來就不聽話，好不容易才找到你，萬一你又跑了怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你恢復意識到入職前，我都不敢出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒，這麼不講道理吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"當然有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我們出維多利亞的時候不就是因為炎熔你鬧彆扭才走散的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那，那是個意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，不許再發生這樣的事了，明白沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這樣才乖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊對了，你做了個什麼夢啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"要是不介意的話，可以放心地把夢境內容分享給姐姐，這樣對恢復精神有好處哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我聽著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我夢見......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"夢見什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"夢見芙蓉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，我聽著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"（拍拍炎熔的臉）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"那快說吧，到底夢見什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，太難為情了！說不出口！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"聽話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼夢都沒做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"小炎熔怎麼一醒來就鬧彆扭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"彆扭倒是挺常見的，臉怎麼也紅紅的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"難道又發燒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"乖乖躺著，給你量個體溫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"量體溫，幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"別把體溫計拿過來，我沒發燒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"病人可沒資格說“沒事”這兩個字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"臉紅和發燒你分不清嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼見到姐姐要臉紅呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"還、還不是因為你在夢裡生病了說話都沒力氣的樣子真要說給你聽很丟臉啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"大概......就是這麼個夢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，聽完還讓人感覺挺高興的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"還不是因為芙蓉......姐姐你平時......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我才沒那麼容易垮呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，但意外總是難以避免的，所以以後可能真的會需要炎熔來看護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，我一直是相信炎熔會在姐姐危難的時候幫上忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然平時又不聽話、又倔強、主意又多、動作還特別快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你這是在拐彎抹角數落我嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"有東西吃嘛，我有點餓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"有，有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，難得小炎熔這麼配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等一下，我這就給你拿過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（原來那時候，姐姐也在啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（我就在想怎麼有個聲音這麼熟悉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果不是約翰老師，芙蓉應該見不到我了吧......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（不知道老師在萊塔尼亞過得怎麼樣了，像他這樣有才華的音樂家，應該已經打出名聲了吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（信......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（也不知道爸媽什麼時候會回信......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（大家......過得都很艱難......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果我能更強大的話......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"來啦來啦，這是新鮮出爐的粥哦，趁熱吃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（聞了聞）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"好像沒什麼味道，不是肉粥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"你夢裡才是肉粥，這是最新研發的健康粥哦，好吃又健康！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（健康？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你，等等，難道你把你自己做的那個什麼健康粉撒粥裡了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。這樣會好吸收一點，也能更快把營養成分送入身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"姑且問一句......你自己嘗過味道嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐一日三餐都在吃哦，營養特別均衡。所以生病的才是小炎熔而不是姐姐我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"來嘗嘗吧，健康才是最重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不要，我一口都不會喝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我好不容易改良出來的，嘗嘗嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不會信！上次你也說改良，結果還不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔！！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"好像，味道是有點，能接受了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"？！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"噁，不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不對不對，這個回味，怎麼回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔，你說的改良難道就只是讓味道滯後嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，這樣是不是能一口氣把粥喝完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，我和你沒完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"記著，我跟你......嘔......沒完！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔","芙蓉"]},{"speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","aliases":["芙蓉"]},{"speakerId":"char_121_lava","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_212_ansel","aliases":["安賽爾"]}]}
